== Native ABI and typed regressions
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-interpreter-native
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-interpreter
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-ir-interpreter
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-interpreter-link
== Aggregate and variadic integration [4 CPUs]
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-ir-lowering
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-ssa-source --typed tests/interpreter/source.c
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" interpret-c --check-undefined tests/interpreter/units-main.c tests/interpreter/units-library.c > build/review-units.out && printf 'typed units: 1\n' | cmp - build/review-units.out
== Source syntax and sign-off audit
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" -fsyntax-only -march=native -Isrc -fwrapv -funsigned-char -fno-strict-aliasing -Wall -Werror src/buster/compiler/main.c
(cd ../final-audit.git && ../dco audit --base e7d3fc79e7528f987280b5b12b0e72fb65b8351a --head qualify176-review)
